{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】灣仔昨晚有私家車失事撞壆翻側，司機涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。</p>\n<p>私家車車身損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂，安全氣袋彈出。</p>\n<p>昨晚10時許，該輛私家車沿夏慤道往中環方向行駛，駛至近軍器廠街時，懷疑失控撞向路中石壆後翻側，34歲男司機受傷，送往律敦治醫院治理。警方經初步調查後，司機涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:40:37.588137+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:37:47.841031+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:37:47.841031+00:00","content_hash":"9ac38fd1d2e2ee1944b7250fb69bdba1e44acb063c221cb531a22645c4e22baf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}